{"id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-schnorrrandom.md","title":"Schnorr 随机性","display":"df-schnorrrandom — Schnorr 随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-schnorrrandom"],"display":"df-schnorrrandom — Schnorr 随机性","label":"43-df-schnorrrandom","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-schnorrtest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.2 Definition 10.2.1，印刷213–214，PDF233–234；§16.2相对化，印刷489，PDF509","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-schnorrrandom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-schnorrrandom — Schnorr 随机性"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-schnorrrandom"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.2 Definition 10.2.1，印刷213–214，PDF233–234；§16.2相对化，印刷489，PDF509"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^{B}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^{B}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a>。下式定义相对及非相对 Schnorr 随机性谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^{A}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^{A}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^{\\varnothing}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^{\\varnothing}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>集合或其特征序列经 AsSet 指定同一预言机；检验的枚举及测度近似均依赖该预言机。测度的统一可计算性已在 SchnorrTest 中给出。</p>\n<p>书目定位沿用附件的 §10.2 Definition 10.2.1 和 §16.2；本轮核查参数类型与相对接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id"